<title>USA: Vermont Auditor Flanagan wins re-election.</title>
<headline>Vermont Auditor Flanagan wins re-election.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vermont's Auditor of Accounts, Edward Flanagan, defeated Republican Gerald Morrissey in the Nov 5 election.</p>
<p>Unofficial vote totals give Flanagan a 10 percentage point victory in what was considered one of Vermont's hottest races.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
